  "description": "Introducing the Swift CVT, the ultimate eBike designed for those who demand performance and convenience. With its innovative removable top tube, this bike easily adapts to your lifestyle. The belt drive system, combined with a Continuously Variable Transmission (CVT), ensures a smooth, silent, and maintenance-free ride for up to 30,000 kilometers, keeping your hands and pants clean. The powerful 500W mid-drive motor delivers a rugged and responsive ride, rated for Class 3 speeds. Enjoy seamless shifting with the Enviolo hub, offering infinite gear ratios without any clunking. Dual-piston brakes provide reliable stopping power, while puncture-resistant tires and dual battery capability (48V15Ah included, 48V21Ah optional second battery) ensure you can ride further with confidence.",
